# Generated by render.sh — rebuilt from the markdown beside it. The PDF is
# deliberately NOT ignored: it is the artifact handed to the alignment session.
build/

# A phantom ideate store keeps appearing here: `loadConfig` lazily onboards
# wherever it is pointed and does not walk up to find the enclosing project, so
# any ideate command-line call whose working directory is this one starts a new
# store instead of joining the project's. Twelve records accumulated that way
# and were discarded on 2026-08-04 (all duplicates or spurious re-reports — see
# board item 01KZ72R4NBMH9CDD0CDHS7FMDA, which tracks the underlying bug).
# These lines stay until that item closes: the cause is still live, so the
# directory can repopulate at any time, and this repo is the public-facing one
# (P-39 — nothing enters public history by accident).
.ideate/
.ideate-telemetry/
.ideate.json
